'''Brains''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2016 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2016|2016 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is pink in color with gyri and blood vessels imprinted over it, resembling a brain, hence the name. The guard is red, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*This knife was obtained from the first Halloween event box ever in [[Murder Mystery 2]].

